hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"310","[AI-translation] Ham se Harun bin Ishaq ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abda ne riwayat ki, Hisham bin Urwah se, un ke waalid se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef laye aur mere paas ek aurat maujood thi. Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kaun hai? Maine kaha: Falanah hai jo raat ko soti nahi. Toh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum par aamal mein se woh (karna chahiye) jo tum bardasht kar sako. Allah ki qasam! Allah us amal se thakta nahi jab tak tum thak na jao. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko aamal mein sab se mehbob woh tha jis par uska karne wala daman rakhe."
"311","[AI-translation] Ham se Abu Hisham Muhammad bin Yazeed al-Rifa'i ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ibn Fudayl ne riwayat ki, Al-A'mash se, Abu Salih se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Aisha aur Umm Salama se poocha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko sab se mehbob amal kaunsa tha? Dono ne farmaya: Woh amal jis par daman rakha jaye, agarche kam ho."
"312","[AI-translation] Ham se Muhammad bin Ismail ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abdullah bin Salih ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Muawiya bin Salih ne riwayat ki, Amr bin Qays se, ke unhone Asim bin Humayd ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Awf bin Malik ko khte hue suna: Main ek raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke sath tha. Toh aap ne miswak ki, phir wuzu kiya, phir namaz ke liye khade ho gaye. Main bhi unke sath khada ho gaya. Toh aap ne shuru kiya aur Surah Al-Baqarah ki tilawat ki. Aap rahmat ki aya guzar te toh thehar jate aur dua mangte, aur azaab ki aya guzar te toh thehar jate aur panaah maangte. Phir aap ne ruku ki aur qiyam ke barabar (waqt) ruku mein thehar gaye, aur ruku mein yeh kehte: Subhana dhi al-jabarut wa al-malakut, wa al-kibriya'i wa al-azama. Phir aap ne ruku ke barabar sajda kiya, aur sajde mein yeh kehte: Subhana dhi al-jabarut wa al-malakut, wa al-kibriya'i wa al-azama. Phir aap ne Surah Aal-e-Imran padhi, phir ek aur surah, har rakat mein aisi hi karte."
"313","[AI-translation] Ham se Qutaybah bin Sa'eed ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein al-Layth ne hadith bayan ki, Ibn Abi Mulaykah se, Ya'la bin Mamlak se, ke unhone Umm Salmah se Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki qira'at ke baray mein poocha, to unhone aisi qira'at ki sifat bayan ki jo mufassir thi, harf ba harf."
"314","[AI-translation] Ham se Muhammad bin Bashshaar ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Wahb bin Jareer bin Hazim ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein mere waalid ne hadith bayan ki, Qatadah se, kahne lage: Maine Anas bin Maalik se poocha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki qira'at kaisi thi? To unhone farmaya: Madd ke saath."
"315","[AI-translation] Hamein Ali bin Hujr ne hadith bayan ki, kaha: Hamein Yahya bin Sa'id al-Umawi ne hadith bayan ki Ibn Jurayj se, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, Umm Salama se, unhonne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni qirat ko kaatte the, farmate: Al-hamdu lillahi rabbil 'alamin phir thehar jate, phir farmate: Ar-Rahmanir-Rahim phir thehar jate, aur Maliki yawmid-din padhte the."
